### API + SP mapping

**`HomeDashboardApi` constants:**

- Filters → `DASH_Overview_GetFilter` (`@ScienceID`, `@ListType`)
- KPI data → `DASH_MainSummary_GetData` (`@YearID`, `@Semester`, `@ScienceID`, `@CourseID`, `@ResultSet`)
- Charts also call: `DASH_StudentClassSize_GetData`, `DASH_StudentEthic_GetData`, `DASH_StudentSanction_GetData`, `DASH_StudentReward_GetData`

