### How ScienceID / CourseID / ClassID / FromDate / ToDate are sent

Config in ASCX → multi-select DOM IDs + date inputs:

```51:56:g:\0.0.0.Dashboard\cd-21\hisa\Dashboards\Student\StudentClassSizeDashboard.ascx
            window.scsDashFilterConfig = {
                scienceId: "<%= uClassFilter.ScienceClientID %>",
                courseId: "<%= uClassFilter.CourseClientID %>",
                classId: "<%= uClassFilter.ClassClientID %>",
                fromDate: "scsDashFromDate",
                toDate: "scsDashToDate"
            };
```

JS reads multi-select as comma-joined IDs (`""` if “Tất cả”), dates as `input[type=date]` values (`yyyy-MM-dd`):

```484:505:g:\0.0.0.Dashboard\cd-21\hisa\assetsDashboard\js\pages\student-class-size-dashboard.init.js
    function getFiltersFromDom() {
        readFilterConfig();
        return {
            scienceId: getSelectValue(filterConfig.scienceId),
            courseId: getSelectValue(filterConfig.courseId),
            classId: getSelectValue(filterConfig.classId),
            fromDate: filterConfig.fromDate ? getSelectValue(filterConfig.fromDate) : "",
            toDate: filterConfig.toDate ? getSelectValue(filterConfig.toDate) : ""
        };
    }
    // ...
            postJson({
                action: "data",
                scienceId: filters.scienceId,
                courseId: filters.courseId,
                classId: filters.classId,
                fromDate: filters.fromDate,
                toDate: filters.toDate
            }, callback);
```

API maps camelCase → SP params:

```78:149:g:\0.0.0.Dashboard\cd-21\hisa\Dashboards\API\StudentClassSizeDashboardApi.ashx.cs
            string strScienceId = GetRequestValue(context, "scienceId");
            string strCourseId = GetRequestValue(context, "courseId");
            string strClassId = GetRequestValue(context, "classId");
            string strFromDate = GetRequestValue(context, "fromDate");
            string strToDate = GetRequestValue(context, "toDate");
            // ...
            return objClass.GetDataTable(
                SP_DATA,
                "@ScienceID", NormalizeFilter(scienceId),
                "@CourseID", NormalizeFilter(courseId),
                "@ClassID", NormalizeFilter(classId),
                "@ResultSet", resultSet,
                "@FromDate", NormalizeDate(fromDate),
                "@ToDate", NormalizeDate(toDate));
```

SP signature:

```9:17:g:\0.0.0.Dashboard\cd-21\sql\DASH_StudentClassSize_GetData.sql
ALTER PROCEDURE [dbo].[DASH_StudentClassSize_GetData]
(
    @ScienceID nvarchar(1000) = NULL,
    @CourseID nvarchar(1000) = NULL,
    @ClassID nvarchar(1000) = NULL,
    @ResultSet tinyint = NULL,
    @FromDate datetime = NULL,
    @ToDate datetime = NULL
)
```

Filter API: `listType` 1=Khoa, 2=Khóa, 3=Lớp; body also sends `scienceId`, `courseId`.

