## Side-by-side

| | Main / School | StudentClassSize |
|--|---------------|------------------|
| API | `HomeDashboardApi.ashx` | `StudentClassSizeDashboardApi.ashx` |
| Filter SP | `DASH_Overview_GetFilter` | `DASH_StudentClassSize_GetFilter` |
| Data SP | `DASH_MainSummary_GetData` (+ module SPs for charts) | `DASH_StudentClassSize_GetData` |
| Filters | yearId, semester, scienceId, courseId | scienceId, courseId, classId, fromDate, toDate |
| Date filter | **No** | **Yes** (`@FromDate`/`@ToDate`) |
| Year/Semester | UI + charts (ethic/sanction/reward); KPI ignores year/semester | Hidden / unused for this page’s data path |
